11743-USAGE:
11744-  lake env [<cmd>] [<args>...]
11745-Spawns a new process executing `cmd` with the given `args` and with
11746-the environment set based on the detected Lean/Lake installations and
11747-the workspace configuration (if it exists).
11748-Specifically, this command sets the following environment variables:
11749-  LAKE                  set to the detected Lake executable
11750-  LAKE_HOME             set to the detected Lake home
11751:  LEAN_SYSROOT          set to the detected Lean toolchain directory
11752-  LEAN_AR               set to the detected Lean `ar` binary
