11754-  LEAN_PATH             adds Lake's and the workspace's Lean library dirs
11755-  LEAN_SRC_PATH         adds Lake's and the workspace's source dirs
11756-  PATH                  adds Lean's, Lake's, and the workspace's binary dirs
11757-  PATH                  adds Lean's and the workspace's library dirs (Windows)
11758-  DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH     adds Lean's and the workspace's library dirs (MacOS)
11759-  LD_LIBRARY_PATH       adds Lean's and the workspace's library dirs (other)
