codex
The failure was caused by the sandbox hiding `/proc/<pid>/exe`, which Lean 4.22 uses for its installation path even though `/proc/self/exe` is available. A narrowly scoped preload shim redirects only Lean’s own-PID lookup to that equivalent alias; the pinned Lean commit now reports correctly and a clean diagnostic build succeeds. I’m rerunning the required `check_generation` with this environment only.
